
 Universal Control · details  as heard by: recording                                                           20:11:14

 Universal Control drops a device from its list when no reading of -61 dBm or stronger arrives from it for 120 s. A
 reading of -57 dBm or stronger reliably brings it back.
 Default thresholds, measured on macOS 27. The log has no decisions yet to check them against.

